A `FoundationEmbeddingModelConfig` is no longer accepted as a model of its own in `ExperimentConfig.models`: it is the backbone of a `FrozenBackboneDecoderConfig`, which adds the classical head that decodes from its embeddings. On its own, `Experiment` built a bare backend from it, with no head and without the sampling rate and channels, and every fold failed when scikit-learn cloned it (`AttributeError: ... has no attribute 'feat_dim'`). The decoding guide shows it as a backbone.
